{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "genji-modern",
  "chunk_id": "genji-modern-chunk-0531",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "此时紫儿为恋念外祖母，正倒在床上哭泣。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "At that moment, little Murasaki was lying on her bed crying because she missed her grandmother.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "陪伴她玩耍的女童对她说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A young girl who had been playing with her said to her:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "“一个穿官袍的人来了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A man in court robes has come.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "恐怕是你爸爸呢。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Perhaps it is your father.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "紫儿就起来，走出去看。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Murasaki got up and went out to look.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "她叫着乳母问道：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "She called to her nurse and asked:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "“少纳言妈妈！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Mother Shonagon!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "穿官袍的人在哪里？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Where is the man in court robes?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "是爸爸来了么？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Has Father come?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "她一边问，一边走近乳母身边来，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As she asked, she came closer to her nurse,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "其声音非常可爱。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and her voice was very sweet.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "源氏公子对她说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Prince Genji said to her:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "“不是爸爸，是我。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is not your father. It is I.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "我也不是外人。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I am not a stranger either.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "来，到这里来！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Come, come over here!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "紫儿隔帘听得出这就是上次来的那个源氏公子。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "From behind the curtain, Murasaki recognized his voice as that of Prince Genji, who had come before.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 17,
      "source_text": "认错了人，很难为情，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Having mistaken him for someone else, she felt very embarrassed,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 18,
      "source_text": "便依傍到乳母身边去，说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so she drew close to her nurse and said:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 19,
      "source_text": "“去吧，我想睡觉。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Go away. I want to sleep.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 20,
      "source_text": "源氏公子说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Prince Genji said:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 21,
      "source_text": "“你不要再躲避了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Do not hide from me anymore.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 22,
      "source_text": "就在我膝上睡觉吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Sleep here on my lap.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 23,
      "source_text": "来，走近来些！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Come, come a little closer!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 24,
      "source_text": "少纳言乳母说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Nurse Shonagon said:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 25,
      "source_text": "“您看，真是一点也不懂事的。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You see, she truly does not understand anything at all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 26,
      "source_text": "便将这小姑娘推近源氏公子这边去。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Then she pushed the little girl closer toward Prince Genji.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 27,
      "source_text": "紫儿只是呆呆地隔着帷屏坐着。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Murasaki merely sat there blankly on the other side of the curtain screen.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 28,
      "source_text": "源氏公子把手伸进帷屏里，摸摸她的头发。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Prince Genji reached his hand inside the screen and touched her hair.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 29,
      "source_text": "那长长的头发披在软软的衣服上，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Her long hair lay spread over her soft garments,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 30,
      "source_text": "柔顺致密，感觉异常美好。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "supple and fine, with an extraordinarily lovely feel.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 31,
      "source_text": "他便握住了她的手。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Then he took her hand.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 32,
      "source_text": "紫姬看见这个不相熟的人如此亲近她，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Seeing this unfamiliar man come so close to her,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 33,
      "source_text": "畏缩起来，又对乳母说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Lady Murasaki shrank back in fear and said again to her nurse:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 34,
      "source_text": "“我想睡觉呀！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I want to sleep!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 35,
      "source_text": "用力把身子退进里面。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "She pulled herself hard farther inside.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 36,
      "source_text": "源氏公子便乘势跟着她钻进帷屏里面去，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Prince Genji took the chance and followed her inside the screen,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 37,
      "source_text": "一面说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "saying as he did so:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 38,
      "source_text": "“现在我是爱护你的人了，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "From now on, I am someone who will care for you,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 39,
      "source_text": "你不要讨厌我！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so do not dislike me!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 40,
      "source_text": "少纳言乳母困窘地说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Nurse Shonagon said in distress:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 41,
      "source_text": "“啊呀，太不像样了！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Oh dear, this is terribly improper!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 42,
      "source_text": "无论对她怎样说，都没有用的啊。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "No matter what one says to her, it is no use.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 43,
      "source_text": "源氏公子对乳母说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Prince Genji said to the nurse:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 44,
      "source_text": "“对她这样年幼的人，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "With someone as young as she is,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 45,
      "source_text": "我还能把她怎样呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "what could I possibly do to her?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00531",
      "unit_index": 46,
      "source_text": "只是要表白我的一片世间无例的真心。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I only want to show her the sincerity of my heart, unmatched anywhere in the world.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
